---
import Image from "astro/components/Image.astro";
import LineEffect from "../assets/others/Line Effect.webp";
---

<section
    class="w-full h-screen flex flex-col gap-5 items-center justify-center px-3 md:px-0"
>
    <div class="relative">
        <Image src={LineEffect} alt="effect" loading="lazy" class="w-10 md:w-12 absolute -right-12 md:-right-16 -top-5" />
        <h1 class="font-bold text-3xl md:text-4xl text-white">Lore & Story</h1>
    </div>

    <div class="max-w-2xl bg-white p-4 flex flex-col items-end gap-6">
        <p>
            In Tafiya Tare players drive a trusty pickup truck toward the
            legendary Peak of Truth to seek the elixir of immortality, but
            dwindling fuel forces them to stop at seven distinct villages that
            reflect different facets of human ego. From the peaceful,
            capybara-inhabited Faith village and the eccentric, fog-shrouded Art
            Joker town, to the tragic, trash-filled dried ocean of Aqua Home,
            players must complete local eco-friendly mini-games and invite
            diverse villagers to join their journey. However, upon reaching the
            summit after meeting the enlightened Cave dwellers who ask, Why live
            forever if the world is dying? a mysterious elder reveals a profound
            twist: immortality is completely meaningless if our natural world is
            destroyed. Ultimately, the story highlights the game's title,
            meaning walking together, proving that true survival requires
            collective cooperation and a shared heart to protect our only home.
        </p>
        <div class="flex flex-col text-right">
            <span>Traveler 20XX</span>
            <span class="text-xs"
                >Nothing lasts forever if we don't take care of it</span
            >
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
